  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"x plus 5 equals 14\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mn>14</mn>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 4 x squared plus 4\"><mrow>\n\t<mi>y</mi>\n\t<mo>=</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mrow>\n\t\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t\t</msup>\n\t\t</mrow>\n\t\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t\t<mn>4</mn>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">At what point <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x comma y right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> do the graphs of the equations in the given system intersect?</p>",
